; globex.test — a domain to prove locally (ADR-0054). Claim it in Globex's
; Settings → Single sign-on, then publish the record the page shows by adding
; a line like the one below, raising the serial, and saving. CoreDNS reloads it.
$ORIGIN globex.test.
$TTL 60
@   IN SOA ns.globex.test. hostmaster.globex.test. ( 2026102301 60 60 600 60 )
@   IN NS  ns.globex.test.
ns  IN A   127.0.0.1
; _patchgrid-verify IN TXT "patchgrid-verify=<the challenge Settings shows>"
